{"abstract":[{"text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), or once per Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy"},{"text":") before every presentation — in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; without one, iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","do